          %title
          %p Peter Christopher West is professor of mathematics at King’s college London.
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_West_(physicist)"} Wikipedia entry
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "https://www.kcl.ac.uk/people/peter-west"} institute page
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "https://kclpure.kcl.ac.uk/portal/en/persons/peter.west"} institute page
          %h2#selected_writings Selected writings
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity"} supergravity
            formulated on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+spacetime"} super spacetime
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supermanifolds"} supermanifolds
            (“
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superspace"}> superspace
            ”):
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/S.+James+Gates+Jr."}> S. James Gates Jr.
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kellogg+S.+Stelle"} Kellogg S. Stelle
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+C.+West"} Peter C. West
              = succeed "," do
                %em Algebraic origins of superspace constraints in supergravity
              %strong 169
              3–4 (1980) 347-364 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(80)90037-1"}> doi:10.1016/0550-3213(80)90037-1
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Early construction of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+IIA+supergravity"} type IIA supergravity
          %ul
            %li
              I. C. G. Campbell,
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+C.+West"} Peter C. West
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi N
                        %mo =
                        %mn 2
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N = 2
                  ,
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi D
                        %mo =
                        %mn 10
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D = 10
                  non-chiral supergravity and its spontaneous compactification
              %strong 243
              1 (1984) 112-124 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(84)90388-2"}> doi:10.1016/0550-3213(84)90388-2
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Green-Schwarz+mechanism"} Green-Schwarz mechanism
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactification
            of
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+supergravity"} heterotic supergravity
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+superstring"} heterotic superstring
            to 6 dimensions (see also at
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D6+N%3D%281%2C0%29+SCFT"} D=6 N=(1,0) SCFT
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Green"}> Michael Green
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Schwarz"} John Schwarz
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pete+West"} Pete West
              = succeed "," do
                %em Anomaly-free chiral theories in six dimensions
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(85)90222-6"} doi:10.1016/0550-3213(85)90222-6
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Landau-Ginzburg+models"} Landau-Ginzburg models
            in the sense of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sigma+models"} sigma models
            with certain
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/potential+energy"} potentials
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Howe"}> Paul Howe
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
              = succeed "," do
                %em Landau-Ginzburg Hamiltonians, string theory and critical phenomena
              = succeed "," do
                %em Proceedings of 25th International Conference on High Energy Physics
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/301119"} inspire:301119
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/files/f9b5ac3ccd39ef8c30ca5c7b69b92fc8"} pdf
          %p
            On the fundamental
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Green-Schwarz+sigma-model"} Green-Schwarz sigma-model
          %ul
            %li#HoweSezginWest97
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Howe"}> Paul Howe
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ergin+Sezgin"} Ergin Sezgin
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
              = succeed "," do
                %em Covariant Field Equations of the M Theory Five-Brane
              %strong 399
              (1997) 49-59 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9702008"}> arXiv:hep-th/9702008
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0370-2693(97)00257-8"} doi:10.1016/S0370-2693(97)00257-8
          %p
            On obtaining
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/massive+type+IIA+supergravity"} massive type IIA supergravity
            from a form of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D11+supergravity"} D=11 supergravity
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+S.+Howe"}> Paul S. Howe
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+D.+Lambert"} Neil D. Lambert
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+C.+West"} Peter C. West
              = succeed "," do
                %em A New Massive Type IIA Supergravity From Compactification
              %strong 416
              (1998) 303-308 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9707139"}> arXiv:hep-th/9707139
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0370-2693(97)01199-4"} doi:10.1016/S0370-2693(97)01199-4
          %p
            On the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/3-brane+in+6d"} 3-brane in 6d
            as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black brane
            in an
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/NS5-brane"} NS5-brane
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldvolume"} worldvolume
          %ul
            %li#HoweLambertWest97
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Howe"}> Paul Howe
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"} Neil Lambert
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Threebrane Soliton of the M-Fivebrane
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9710033"} arXiv:hep-th/9710033
          %p
            and of its relation to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D4+N%3D2+super+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=4 N=2 super Yang-Mills theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Howe"}> Paul Howe
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"} Neil Lambert
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Classical M-Fivebrane Dynamics and Quantum
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi N
                          %mo =
                          %mn 2
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N=2
                    Yang-Mills
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9710034"} arXiv:hep-th/9710034
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Gauge Fields and M-Fivebrane Dynamics
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9712040"} arXiv:hep-th/9712040
            %li#LambertWest98
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi N
                          %mo =
                          %mn 2
